From 03851d7ff8e26efb5e65d8667d44349bd6689f55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Easy Buy <122056680+Volttaik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 22:12:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Make creator pricing authoritative and default subscription
 price explicit
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- resolveBasePrice with DEFAULT_SUBSCRIPTION_PRICE=200 applied on
  become-creator, settings GET/PATCH, verification, and bank-details paths
- /api/users/:username resolves price instead of raw profile value
- POST /albums accepts price as alias for unlock_price
- Schema default and idempotent migrate backfill for unpriced creator rows

Generated with Codebuff 🤖
Co-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
